ut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> operations per second it takes about <span class=\"blank\" data-blank=\"0\">[ 1 ]</span> seconds.</p>",
